My left pocket.

1558
02:05:54,711 --> 02:05:56,576
Howard, it's Kate.

1559
02:05:56,680 --> 02:05:59,079
I need to talk to you.

1560
02:06:00,217 --> 02:06:02,209
Can you hear me?

1561
02:06:04,596 --> 02:06:07,134
I'm coming in.

1562
02:06:11,520 --> 02:06:14,272
Howard, unlock this door immediately.

1563
02:06:22,614 --> 02:06:25,651
I can't, sweetie.

1564
02:06:28,036 --> 02:06:30,610
You mean you won't.

1565
02:06:31,832 --> 02:06:35,655
Howard, please let me see you.

1566
02:06:35,760 --> 02:06:37,655
I haven't shaved.

1567
02:06:37,760 --> 02:06:40,708
Well, neither have I.

1568
02:06:43,760 --> 02:06:45,360
Come on.

1569
02:06:45,896 --> 02:06:48,696
You let me in.

1570
02:06:55,689 --> 02:06:59,513
I can hear you, Katie.

1571
02:06:59,617 --> 02:07:04,848
I could always hear you.
Even in the cockpit, with the engines on.

1572
02:07:04,952 --> 02:07:08,697
Well, that's because I'm so goddamn loud.

1573
02:07:13,999 --> 02:07:16,075
Howard, I...

1574
02:07:18,212 --> 02:07:21,120
I came to thank you.

1575
02:07:21,224 --> 02:07:24,577
I found out what you did
for Spence and me.

1576
02:07:24,682 --> 02:07:27,428
Buying those awful pictures.

1577
02:07:32,559 --> 02:07:34,303
You love him.

1578
02:07:40,984 --> 02:07:43,558
He's everything I have.

1579
02:07:51,620 --> 02:07:53,020
Howard.

1580
02:07:54,632 --> 02:07:57,956
I'm glad for you, Kate.

1581
02:07:58,502 --> 02:08:01,948
Go away now.
Would you do that?

1582
02:08:02,052 --> 02:08:04,162
Howard, please.

1583
02:08:04,266 --> 02:08:09,207
Go away.
Just for now. I'll see you soon.

1584
02:08:09,312 --> 02:08:11,707
- We'll go flying together.
- Yes.

1585
02:08:11,811 --> 02:08:14,753
Yes, please.
You take me flying again.

1586
02:08:14,858 --> 02:08:18,018
Howard, I can take the wheel.

1587
02:08:23,652 --> 02:08:25,052
Howard?

1588
