2050
02:41:44,702 --> 02:41:47,558
The way of the future.
The way of the future.

2051
02:41:47,662 --> 02:41:51,313
The way of the future. The way
of the future. The way of the future.

2052
02:41:51,417 --> 02:41:53,896
The way of the future.
The way of the future. The way...

2053
02:41:54,000 --> 02:41:58,068
All right, stay here. I'll be right back.
Do you understand, Howard?

2054
02:41:58,173 --> 02:42:00,012
The way of the future.
The way of the future.

2055
02:42:00,116 --> 02:42:03,742
Guard the door. I'll get a doctor.
No one sees him like this.

2056
02:42:03,846 --> 02:42:07,255
The way of the future. The way
of the future. The way of the future.

2057
02:42:08,427 --> 02:42:11,834
The way of the future. The way
of the future. The way of the future.

2058
02:42:11,939 --> 02:42:14,416
The way of the fut...

2059
02:42:14,520 --> 02:42:17,968
The way of the future.
The way of the future.

2060
02:42:24,109 --> 02:42:27,509
You are not safe.

2061
02:42:34,745 --> 02:42:39,567
When I grow up, I'm gonna fly
the fastest planes ever built,

2062
02:42:39,672 --> 02:42:42,325
make the biggest movies ever,

2063
02:42:42,429 --> 02:42:45,455
and be the richest man in the world.

2064
02:42:58,644 --> 02:43:01,007
The way of the future.

2065
02:43:08,779 --> 02:43:11,025
The way of the future.

2066
02:43:19,039 --> 02:43:21,024
The way of the future.

2067
02:43:24,336 --> 02:43:26,248
The way of the future.

2068
02:43:28,257 --> 02:43:30,161
The way of the future.

2069
02:43:31,802 --> 02:43:33,545
The way of the future.
